<title>UK: BSkyB down on digital TV competition reports.</title>
<headline>BSkyB down on digital TV competition reports.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Sky Broadcasting (BSkyB) dropped on Tuesday on newspaper reports that a rival digital television network was launching an aggressive bid for rights to screen sporting events, dealers said.</p>
<p>BSkyB shares fell 16-1/2p to 633-1/2p by 1250 GMT.</p>
</text>
